{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04916","headline":"夏日都门送司马员外逸客孙员外佺北征 · 李乂","name":"夏日都门送司马员外逸客孙员外佺北征","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日逐滋南寇，天威抚北垂。\n析珪行仗节，持印且分麾。\n羽檄双凫去，兵车驷马驰。\n虎旗悬气色，龙剑抱雄雌。\n候月期戡翦，经时念别离。\n坐闻关陇外，无复引弓儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04916.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04916","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}